# SPA fallback: serve index.html for every client-side route (HTTP 200 rewrite,
# visible URL unchanged). Netlify's Pretty URLs setting already normalises
# trailing slashes, so explicit /path/ -> /path rules are NOT added here:
# Netlify matches /path/ and /path with the same rule, which caused an
# infinite 301 redirect loop on /projects, /about, /contact and the legacy URLs.
/*    /index.html   200
